      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Oh, some clarification:\n\nSDK3 allows users to make their own climbing system (ladders!) and it fixes the 'spamming spacebar to climb' bug.\n\nBut it *technically* doesn't implement climbing into the SDK.\n\nIf a climbing system in SDK3 is still something you'd like to request, please make a new request! Hope that makes sense. ♥",
